#      1:    153: ! * substantially.                                                               *
#      1:    154: ! *                                                                              *
#      1:    155: ! * Pascal-P4 is unlicensed and exists in the public domain. It has:             *
#      1:    156: ! *                                                                              *
#      1:    157: ! * 1. Been acknowledged as public domain by the author, Niklaus Wirth at ETH    *
#      1:    158: ! *    Zurich.                                                                   *
